BEVFormer TensorRT standalone tools

Extracted on 2026-10-20 from the TensorRT tooling of:
https://github.com/luogantt/General-AI-Compiler
Source tooling revision: 24baf60ca79318cb072881177613608c453a4ea7
The source project's pyproject.toml declares Apache-2.0 for its code.

This package preserves the numerical adapters, calibration bindings and runtime
logic, changes imports and CLI entry points for standalone installation, and adds
independent packaging, documentation and validation.

NVIDIA TensorRT, CUDA and their plugins are external dependencies distributed
under their own licenses. PyTorch, ONNX, NumPy and OpenCV are also external
dependencies; their code is not relicensed by this project.

BEVFormer checkpoint weights and nuScenes data are NOT covered by this project's
code license. Optional model assets must retain their source and license terms.
The source distribution contains neither full model weights nor nuScenes images.

The tiny synthetic tests/fixtures are numerical DCNv2/MSDA test vectors generated
by General-AI-Compiler native/tests/generate_base_ops_models.py; no trained
checkpoint weights or dataset samples are included in those fixtures.
